  "usage_note": "*Shut up!* is rude when it means *stop talking*. Polite ways to ask someone to stop talking are *Could you be quiet, please?* and *Could you keep it down?* Among friends, *Shut up!* can also show happy surprise (sense 4); the tone of voice makes the difference.",
